# 焼き付けを、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う (design 17.13), for
# tools/ui_run.py. A figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at
# 100,100; its 道具パネル at the top of the screen (100,0). With the canvas a picture is made
# from 300,250 to 420,330 and a stroke of the pencil drawn in it, Escape writing it; with the
# rectangle template a rectangle is drawn from 350,280 to 450,360, over a corner of the
# picture. The picture alone picked (310,260), the menu opened at 600,600 with 図形操作 under
# the pointer, and 図形操作 > 焼き付け chosen (720,685): the rectangle is drawn into the
# picture's pixels, through an environment of memory (dp_open_mem), and taken out of the
# figure. Saved: record 0 (its UUIDs as noughts) and the picture beside it come out the same,
# byte for byte, and the screens are kept to be compared.
# Keys: Esc 29; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 264 48
wait 300
drag 300 250 420 330
wait 500
drag 320 270 400 270
wait 400
key 29
wait 400
click 298 82
wait 300
drag 350 280 450 360
wait 400
click 298 48
wait 300
click 310 260
wait 400
shot bcmp_k_picked
click 600 600 1
wait 600
move 620 606
wait 150
move 680 606
wait 500
move 700 606
wait 150
move 720 685
wait 150
click 720 685
wait 600
shot bcmp_k_burnt
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum anon
keep kernel
sum res _0_1.png
keep kpng
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
click 264 48
wait 300
drag 300 250 420 330
wait 500
drag 320 270 400 270
wait 400
key 29
wait 400
click 298 82
wait 300
drag 350 280 450 360
wait 400
click 298 48
wait 300
click 310 260
wait 400
shot bcmp_p_picked
logmark
click 600 600 1
wait 600
move 620 606
wait 150
move 680 606
wait 500
move 700 606
wait 150
move 720 685
wait 150
click 720 685
expectsince figure: burnt
wait 600
shot bcmp_p_burnt
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum anon
same kernel
sum res _0_1.png
same kpng
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
